<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32426" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκμαίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drive mad</i> with passion, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκμήνας θυμὸν ἔρωτι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Epigr.</u>
					7.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				5.91
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινι</span>
			<i>with love for</i> her, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				966
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόβῳ τέτρωρον ἐκμαίνων ὄχον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					1229
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόθον ἐκμῆναι</span>
			<i>to kindle mad</i> desire, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				1142
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκμῆναί τινα δωμάτων</span>
			<i>to drive</i> one <i>raving from</i> the house, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				36
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, with pf.
			<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>
			
				Act.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκμέμηνα,</span>
			<i>go mad</i> with passion, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτα
				ἐκμαίνεσθαι ἔς τινα</span>
			<i>rage</i> so against one, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.33
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				1.11.15
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρωτι οὐρανίῳ ἐκμεμηνυῖα
				[διάνοια</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.482
			</span></i>; of mania, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				1.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τοῦ ἀκράτου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Nigr.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			; of sexual passion, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς γυναῖκας ἐκμανείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					8.7.5
				</span></i>
			: also, c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκμανῆναί τινα</span>”
				<i>to be madly in love with..,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anacreont.
					11.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristaenet.
					1.15
				</span></i>
			 tit.; of persons in delirium, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				3.17
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιγ́.</span></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
